{"product_id":"doctorsaurus","title":"Doctorsaurus","description":"\u003cp\u003eA fantastic rhyming, prehistoric debut from Emi-Lou May that's packed with lovable dinosaur characters from Leire Martín!Thumping head? Tummy ache? Nose all sore and sniffy?Then call for Doctorsaurus and she’ll fix you in a jiffy!Triceratops has hurt his horn and T-Rex’s nose is all blocked and snotty. Join Doctorsaurus as she races to the rescue and helps the poorly dinosaurs feel better. But when Brontosaurus has a tummy ache, the dinosaurs get a little more than they bargained for!This light-hearted, poop-tastic and enjoyable story is the perfect tonic for all poorly toddlers. Ideal for fans of all things dinosaurs and readers of The Dinosaur That Pooped a. . . series, Zog and the Flying Doctors and Gigantosaurus.PRAISE FOR DOCTORSAURUS:\"Emi-Lou May absolutely nails [the] perfect mixture of ingredients for a kids’ story . . . Amazing work – I loved it!”- Dr Xand and Dr Chris, Operation Ouch﻿\"Not only a delightful, silly rhyming romp with dinosaurs but reassuring and calming for toddlers dealing with any unnerving first experiences of being poorly.\"- Miranda Hart, actress, comedian and writer\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 245 x 280\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Emi-Lou May\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781788818629\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45662149869721,"sku":"BLK-2-9781788818629","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/681058de8fe6c_Doctorsaurus_Emi-Lou_May.jpg?v=1755876067","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/doctorsaurus","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}